{
    "title": "Stick Empires: Infinity",
    "description": "This is a highly challenging strategy game where you can battle multiple players. With a variety of game modes, characters, and upgrades, you'll need sharp tactics to defend your castle and conquer enemies.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 2000+ Campaigns: A huge array of missions with escalating difficulty to test your strategy.\r\n\u2022 PvP Mode: Engage in battles with other players and climb the leaderboards.\r\n\u2022 Shadow Tower: Progress through increasingly tough levels, earning rewards as you go.\r\n\u2022 Survival Mode: Survive endless waves of enemies, pushing your limits.\r\n\u2022 Unique Characters: Command units like Speartron, Miner, Giant, Zombie Tank with unique abilities.\r\n\u2022 200+ Upgrades: Customize your army with a vast selection of upgrades.\r\n\u2022 Strategic Gameplay: Balance defense and offense as you aim to destroy your opponent's castle.\r\n**** Thank you for playing our game! We\u2019re excited to keep improving and creating more epic adventures for you. Keep fighting and having fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is a highly challenging strategy game where you can battle multiple players. With a variety of game modes, characters, and upgrades, you&#39;ll need sharp tactics to defend your castle and conquer enemies.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 2000+ Campaigns: A huge array of missions with escalating difficulty to test your strategy.<br>\u2022 PvP Mode: Engage in battles with other players and climb the leaderboards.<br>\u2022 Shadow Tower: Progress through increasingly tough levels, earning rewards as you go.<br>\u2022 Survival Mode: Survive endless waves of enemies, pushing your limits.<br>\u2022 Unique Characters: Command units like Speartron, Miner, Giant, Zombie Tank with unique abilities.<br>\u2022 200+ Upgrades: Customize your army with a vast selection of upgrades.<br>\u2022 Strategic Gameplay: Balance defense and offense as you aim to destroy your opponent&#39;s castle.<br>**** Thank you for playing our game! We\u2019re excited to keep improving and creating more epic adventures for you. Keep fighting and having fun!",
